```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "supersede the standing lei with a newer one at the line's tip"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.lei.restrings", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.lei.restrings"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.lei.restrings"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.lei.restrings ~ restring ~ swarm-lei-restring

`lares lei restring --rite <rite> --branch <name>` supersedes the standing lei with a newer one; the door fills `after` from the line's tip, so the line names no `--after`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ restring

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`restring` params=`rite/kukulu branch/main returns/3 ~ a fresh lei of three returns over the tip`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ rite · branch · reach · returns · head · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rite` params=`takes/rite needs/required ~ the rite the lei grants: push, kukulu or keep`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`branch` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the lei's branch`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`reach` params=`takes/reach ~ wide by default, or head`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`returns` params=`takes/n ~ the returns the lei holds, from 1`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`head` params=`takes/commit ~ the head a head-reach pins`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose line this reads or strings, a whole count from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ the row runs in the vessel, where the hand-only gate, the ward and the co-sign stand`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · swarm-lei-nothing-to-restring · swarm-lei-forked · hand-act-only

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ a missing rite, branch or lei, a stray flag, or a malformed count`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`swarm-lei-nothing-to-restring` params=`~ no lei stands on the line; a kui strings its first`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`swarm-lei-forked` params=`~ the line forks; name one tip with a kui --after`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-act-only` params=`~ an AI seat restrung a lei; a person runs the line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ landed · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[lei]] ~ the record's answer`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ the door or the vessel refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

